      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "sake that is brewed in winter, pasteurized, aged over the summer, and distributed in autumn after a second pasteurization",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "夏を越して熟成が進んだこの酒は、実に見事な秋あがりを見せている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "秋あがりの日本酒は、角が取れてまろやかな口当たりが特徴だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "酒蔵の店主が、今年の秋あがりは出来が良いと太鼓判を押した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
